---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contattami | Marcello Melli - Backend Developer">
  <section class="contact-header">
    <h1>Contattami</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Sei interessato a una collaborazione, desideri discutere un progetto backend o vuoi semplicemente entrare in contatto professionale? Utilizza i canali diretti indicati di seguito.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="contact-container">
    <div class="contact-info-card">
      <h2>Informazioni e Canali Diretti</h2>
      <p>Sono sempre aperto a nuove opportunità lavorative, progetti in remoto e collaborazioni tecniche nell'ambito dello sviluppo backend in Python e FastAPI.</p>
      
      <ul class="info-list">
        <li>
          <span class="info-label">Email Professionale</span>
          <a href="mailto:marcellomelli9@gmail.com" class="info-link">marcellomelli9@gmail.com</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="info-label">LinkedIn</span>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/marcellomelli/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="info-link">linkedin.com/in/marcellomelli</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="info-label">GitHub</span>
          <a href="https://github.com/Melli97" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="info-link">github.com/Melli97</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="info-label">Disponibilità</span>
          <span class="info-value">Full-time / Part-time / Remote</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="cv-download-box">
        <h3>Curriculum Vitae</h3>
        <p>Scarica una copia aggiornata del mio CV in formato PDF.</p>
        <a href="/MelliCV10.pdf" download class="btn primary-btn">Scarica il mio CV (PDF)</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .contact-header {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    max-width: 700px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .contact-container {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .contact-info-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: #f8fafc;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .contact-info-card p {
    color: #cbd5e1;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }

  .info-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 30px 0;
  }

  .info-list li {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .info-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .info-link {
    color: var(--accent-color, #38bdf8);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    word-break: break-all;
  }

  .info-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .info-value {
    color: #f8fafc;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .cv-download-box {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-top: 25px;
    margin-top: 25px;
  }

  .cv-download-box h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #f8fafc;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .cv-download-box p {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--accent-color, #0284c7);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
</style>